- R | take the saw out this weekend and cut the hedge back yourself | land: R | v: self-direction, stimulation | lever: subvert | foot: means ties-.03 | chance: 55
- G | leave the hedge to grow, since it was there before either of you | land: G | v: universalism, tradition | lever: loyalty | foot: lesson hedges outlast quarrels | chance: 60
- W>U | ask the council for a mediator to walk the line with both neighbours | land: W | v: conformity, security | lever: voice | foot: place rule.counsel | chance: 60
- U>B | look up the rules on hedge height and hold {rival} to every letter of them | land: U | v: power, self-direction | lever: lead | foot: door made an enemy | chance: 60
